## Frequency data

Word selection uses [wordfreq](https://github.com/rspeer/wordfreq) 3.1.1
English frequency data by Robyn Speer, with credit also to SUBTLEX, Google
Books Ngrams, OpenSubtitles, Wikipedia, and other sources listed in the
wordfreq NOTICE. Frequency data is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Package code is
Apache-2.0. Glosses and example sentences written for this project are
original, not copied from wordfreq.

